              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omulenzi yaakoba lata we ati, ‘Bona eno, emyaka kamaala nga nkugheereza era tikudheemerangaku mu by'ondagira, aye tompangaku waire akabuzi oti nsanhukeku ni bakagwa bange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ono mutabane wo eyadiibuulira ebintu byo mu bamalaaya olwidhie, ng'omwitira ente entototo empiite era ensavu obukalamu!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise yaamukoba ati, ‘Mwana wange iwe oli ninze buliidho, era ebyange byonabyona bibyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tugwaine tusangaale era tusagambe, kuba muto wo ono yali afiire aye azuukire, yali yaghata aye aboneike.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.32"
            ]
